    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27939" root="عتب" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَعْتُوبٌ</span></b>  is for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَعْتُوبٌ عَلَيْهِ</span> [i. e. <i>Reproved,
blamed,</i> or <i>censured;</i> &amp;c.]: Mtr says, it is said
to signify <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُفْسِدٌ</span> [<i>corrupting, rendering unsound,
vitiating,</i> &amp;c.]; but I am not sure of it.
(Har p. 77.)

